Location: _SEA-Scripts/xema-harness/
  xema_harness_260902-01.py  consolidated module (pip-aware FX/JPY/gold,
      configurable spread, net-R after cost, sequential+independent walks,
      per-year/split-half/session windows, every indicator+on/off+internals in
      one XemaConfig dict, precompute-once indicators for 350-450k-row M5 files,
      --verify conformance mode with PASS/PARTIAL/FAIL + exit codes + per-bar diff,
      --sweep per-knob table + settings card)
  README.md                  reconstruction, every parameter, trust model
  fixtures/regression_EURUSD_H1_260101-260828.csv  (kind: REGRESSION) drift guard
  fixtures/TEMPLATE_conformance_EA_LOG.csv         EA-log fixture format/steps

Verified against repo HEAD b0244b7956fe4c2851e71cb956462bd7f3591409.
Defaults are the NEUTRAL EA standard config (EMA 20/50, dual HTF M15+H1 EMA20/50
phase-required, ADX p50 lb100, voters OFF, swing lb20, BE 2R, LPR 3R->2R/4R->3R,
reverse-cross exit). NO per-pair findings baked into defaults.

Reconstruction reads authoritative EA sources (SEA_Presets/Inputs/SignalEngine/
TradeExecutor) and corrects six silent divergences the old scripts carried:
EMA 13/34+swing55 -> 20/50+swing20; single H4 HTF -> dual M15+H1 phase-required;
rolling-min SL -> fractal strength-2 swing; raw EMA-flip revcross -> close on next
qualified opposite signal; per-tick TRAIL -> once-per-bar BE@2R + LPR ladder;
fixed cushions -> instrument/TF-scaled cushion + SL_MinPips floor.

--verify covers an EXIT (REVCROSS + SL), not just entries. Gate proven: PASS=0 on
match, FAIL=1 with per-bar diff on drift, PARTIAL=2 for SignalScan, error=3 clean.
Full-decade M5 sweep surfaces the exit finding (XEMA_NATIVE -17 vs REVCROSS_ONLY
+20 vs FIX2.0 +22): exit choice changes conclusions, so the shipped exits are
modelled faithfully and --verify must cover an exit.

NOTE: conformance vs the EA is UNVERIFIED until an EA_LOG fixture (MT5 tester
collect/log, EURUSD H1, default config) is produced and PASSes; the shipped
REGRESSION fixture only guards harness drift. SL_SwingPipsCushion / RRM_BE_BufferPips
are inherited at runtime in XEMA's preset block — harness ships the EA formulas as
defaults, exact SL prices certified only by an EA_LOG PASS.

ADX dynamic-percentile threshold vectorized (bit-identical to reference over 447k
bars; ~2x faster sweeps). Setup errors print clean message + exit 3, no traceback.
